WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.266
Repeating games with entangled players.

2
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.918
Entangled players play many copies at once:

3
00:00:04.918 --> 00:00:06.937
how often do they beat the value?

4
00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:11.239
A known conditioning estimate, applied round by

5
00:00:11.239 --> 00:00:13.578
round, makes the number of wins concentrate.

6
00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:17.516
Claimed: exponentially unlikely, for every finite game.

7
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:19.204
Lean: weaker rate.
